Z||000005||frontal lobe||09-13-2001||01:17 PM||||Yes, terrorists know we CAN blow up Afghanistan and the entire middle east, and COUNT ON that we won't.  We have to be willing to show them that we WILL blow up countried that harbor and condone terrorist acts of war on our country.  They need to learn it by seeing it and living it.  However, we DON'T need to use nuclear weapons to accomplish this.  Non-nuclear force we have available will be plenty, and won't create the backlash use of nuclear weapons would.<P>Yes, it would be far greater if we could get nations of the world to stop hosting and helping terrorism without blowing them up.  It would be nice if we all had 100 million dollars in the bank and all drove v 8 Fieros and had perfect health and other wonderful things that aren't and won't be reality.<P>People need to wake up to the fact that there are other people and cultures in the world that DO NOT THINK LIKE US.  Morals, logic, decency, compassion-quit thinking all people and cultures are like that.  These type of people by their very actions identify what their thought processes are like and what kind of persuasion they will respond to:  military levels of punishment and damage greater than what THEY can inflict.<P>It's not my wish or blame that it is that way for these countries.  They are bringing it on themselves.  We don't need to ask God to forgive us for our actions that are going to happen:  they are purely defensive actions in response to cruel, inexcusable agression. ||||reg||1
Z||000006||Tonker||09-13-2001||01:27 PM||||The use of Nuclear weapons (or any other bio/chem) is <B>not</B> an acceptable solution whether they be tactical or strategic. I will not have you people destroy my fücking planet with those weapons! <I>If there is a need</I> to carpet bomb an entire country then use conventional weapons. I'm not opposed to flattening a country if it's proven that that's what's required. But, if the US uses nukes in this conflict then it's okay for the Soviets to use them, which makes it okay for the Chinese to use them, which makes it acceptable for the Indians and Pakistanis to use them and so on and so forth. Before you know the whole fücking world is throwing around tactical nukes as if they were toys!<P>There is no occasion where the use of Nuclear weapons is acceptable by any nation. They are not acceptable as a first strike weapon, they are not acceptable in retaliation. The only use of nuclear weapons should be to sit in their silos and armories warning us of how stupid as a race we really are. ||||reg||13
Z||000007||Urchin||09-13-2001||01:33 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Tonker:<BR><B><BR>There is no occasion where the use of Nuclear weapons is acceptable by any nation. They are not acceptable as a first strike weapon, they are not acceptable in retaliation. The only use of nuclear weapons should be to sit in their silos and armories warning us of how stupid as a race we really are. </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>Well said .<BR><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/final.jpg"> <BR>If you can read this, I'm parked.||||reg||1
