Z||000009||frontal lobe||09-13-2001||02:14 PM||||"I will not have YOU people destroy MY..."<P>Well, Tonker, unfortunately for you, as Canadians you have not decided as a people to arm yourselves well enough to dictate to the U.S. what to do or not do.<P>FORTUNATELY for you, the leadership of this country already knows not to use nuclear weapons unless its the case of EXTREMELY DIRE circumstances (like if 1.5 billion chinese and india armies somehow got together and tried to over-run north america and there wouldn't even exist enough conventional weapons to kill that many people), so you can just start taking some slow, deep breaths and calm down a little.<P>OK, now try to remember.  We in the U.S. are your FRIENDS.  We are neighbors.  We aren't going to mess up the neighborhood.||||reg||1
Z||000010||rogergarrison||09-13-2001||02:16 PM||||Im all for mass military retaliation now. We can do lots of damage with regular weapons. I dont believe in use of atomic weapons.<P>I just now see that the American Express building is being evacuated because its propably going to collapse too. Im getting madder and madder.<P>Like they said in Japan after Pearl Harbor, "I think we have awakened a sleeping giant".||||reg||1
Z||000011||Tonker||09-13-2001||02:22 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by frontal lobe:<BR><B>"I will not have YOU people destroy MY..."<BR>OK, now try to remember.  We in the U.S. are your FRIENDS.  We are neighbors.  We aren't going to mess up the neighborhood.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I don't specifically mean Americans. I mean all thoses states that have or are seeking nuclear weapons. I know the Government of the US has very stringent circumstances where they would consider the use of nuclear weapons. The US is really the least of my worries. However, It's a little disheartening to see people throwing around terms like "nuke them until they glow", etc. It certainly isn't Canadians who are suggesting the use of tactical nukes. <P>And yes, it is "MY" planet. Whether you choose to claim your portion of it is up to you, just please make sure you don't screw up mine.<BR>||||reg||1
